</nav></div></header><main><section class="zk-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">ACCESSIBILITY</div><h1>Accessibility Is Part of a Better Digital Experience.</h1><p>Our commitment to making ZKTeco WFM website content easier to access and use.</p></div></section><section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-legal-copy"><h2>Our Commitment</h2><p>ZKTeco WFM is committed to providing a website experience that is usable by as many people as reasonably possible, including people with disabilities.</p><h2>Accessibility Standard</h2><p>Our goal is to design and maintain this website with reference to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA. This statement is a commitment and target, not a representation that every page or third-party component has been independently certified as conformant.</p><h2>Measures We Take</h2><ul><li>Use semantic structure and meaningful headings.</li><li>Support keyboard navigation and visible focus where practical.</li><li>Maintain readable contrast and scalable text.</li><li>Use descriptive links and alternative text for meaningful images.</li><li>Avoid unnecessary motion and provide responsive layouts.</li><li>Review new pages and components for accessibility during site QA.</li></ul><h2>Third-Party Content</h2><p>Some linked resources, embedded services or third-party platforms are outside ZKTeco WFM’s direct control and may provide different accessibility experiences.</p><h2>Need Assistance?</h2><p>If you encounter an accessibility barrier or need information in another format, please <a href="contact">contact ZKTeco WFM</a> and describe the page or content involved so we can evaluate the request.</p><h2>Ongoing Improvement</h2><p>Accessibility is an ongoing process. We expect to review and improve the site as content, technologies and standards evolve.</p></div></div></section></main><footer class="zk-global-footer"><div class="zk-footer-shell"><div class="zk-footer-grid"><div class="zk-